      "content": "That's a good start for the infrastructure side, but the council is also going to ask about the \"social landscape.\" Specifically, they want to know how the current demographic and social makeup of the district affects the area's \"brand\" and its ability to attract the kind of high-income residents and professionals we're targeting. \n\nCould you expand the summary to address the community aspect? We need to describe the current social character in a way that illustrates why the area doesn't currently project the \"image\" or \"stability\" required to attract those new investment groups. Basically, how does the current resident profile impact the district's potential for high-end revitalization?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
